uid "12142844-889a-5ee2-b9bb-a31bbc51020a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186391579 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186391580 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186391579 #edb/ref 1069 "q-335448" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186391579 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186391579 #edb/ref 1071 "$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′}(t) &=-4y(t) \\\\ {y}^{′}(t) &=-4x(t),\\end{aligned}\\right.\\,\\begin{bmatrix}x(1) \\\\ y(1)\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nFind the solution to the initial value problem above.\n\n*Hint: ${e}^{At}=\\begin{bmatrix}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(4t) & -\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(4t) \\\\ -\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(4t) & \\operatorname{cosh}⁡(4t)\\end{bmatrix},$ where $A=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -4 \\\\ -4 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.$*" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186391579 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "6ab60b60-d1a6-5ef2-aaf8-6579001f22b9" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186391579 #edb/ref 1074 "Writing our system in matrix form, we get\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -4 \\\\ -4 & 0\\end{bmatrix}x(t),\n$$\n\nwhere $x(t)=\\begin{bmatrix}x(t) \\\\ y(t)\\end{bmatrix}.$ So, the matrix of the system is $A=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -4 \\\\ -4 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.$\n\nGiven the system ${x}^{′}(t)=Ax(t),$ where $A$ is a constant square matrix, the general solution of the system can be written as\n\n$$\nx(t)=Φ(t)\\,c,\n$$\n\nwhere $Φ(t)$ is a fundamental matrix of the system, and $c$ is a constant vector.\n\nSo, we can write our general solution as\n\n$$\nx(t)={Φ}_{0}(t)c={e}^{At}\\,c,\n$$\n\nwhere ${Φ}_{0}(t)={e}^{At}$ is the standard fundamental matrix of the system. Substituting $t={t}_{0},$ we have\n\n$$\nx({t}_{0})={e}^{A{t}_{0}}\\,c,\n$$\n\nand since ${e}^{At}$ is invertible for all $t,$ we have\n\n$$\nc={e}^{-A{t}_{0}}\\,x({t}_{0}).\n$$\n\nPlugging the above back into our expression for $x(t),$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x(t) & ={e}^{At}\\,{e}^{-A{t}_{0}}\\,x({t}_{0}) \\\\  & ={e}^{A(t-{t}_{0})}\\,x({t}_{0}).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x(t) & ={e}^{A(t-1)}\\,x(1) \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(4(t-1)) & -\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(4(t-1)) \\\\ -\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(4(t-1)) & \\operatorname{cosh}⁡(4(t-1))\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(4(t-1)) \\\\ -2\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(4(t-1))\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186391580 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186391581 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186391580 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186391582 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186391580 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186391583 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186391580 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186391584 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186391580 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186391585 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186391580 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186391580 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186391580 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186391584 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186391580 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "afd92e9b-c3b2-5f27-ae61-1167e9f32949" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186391581 #edb/ref 1080 "\\begin{bmatrix}-2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(4(t-1)) \\\\ 2\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(4(t-1))\\end{bmatrix}" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186391581 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186391581 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "a3c3294a-f087-5672-a53e-117506420382" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186391582 #edb/ref 1080 "\\begin{bmatrix}-2\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(4(t-1)) \\\\ -2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(4(t-1))\\end{bmatrix}" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186391582 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186391582 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "601ea9e6-24b0-535e-bb17-49ca178db97e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186391583 #edb/ref 1080 "\\begin{bmatrix}2\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(4(t-1)) \\\\ -2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(4(t-1))\\end{bmatrix}" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [175921863