w. \n\n$\\text{L1}:\\,$ Let ${Φ}_{0}(t)={e}^{At}$  \n\n$\\text{L2}:\\,$ $x(t)={Φ}_{0}(t)\\,c$ for some constant vector $c$  \n\n$\\text{L3}:\\,$ $x(0)={Φ}_{0}(0)\\,c$  \n\n$\\text{L4}:\\,$ ${Φ}_{0}(0)={I}_{n}$\n\n$\\text{L5}:\\,$ $x(0)=c$  \n\n$\\text{L6}:\\,$ $x(t)={e}^{At}\\,x(0)$\n\nSelect the correct options to justify each step of the reasoning.\n\n$\\,$ Line $\\text{L3}$ follows from $\\text{L2}$ by {{field-1}}.\n\n$\\,$ Line $\\text{L5}$ follows from lines $\\text{L3}$ and $\\text{L4}$ by  {{field-2}}.\n\n$\\,$ Line $\\text{L6}$ follows from line $\\text{L2}$ by substitution from lines {{field-3}}." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396936 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "b476f440-04ac-55c0-bbfe-8012f8f71f27" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396936 #edb/ref 1074 "Let's justify each of the selected steps.\n\n- We first consider lines $\\text{L2}$ and $\\text{L3}.$ Starting from $\\text{L2},$ we have the identity\n\n$$\nx(t)={Φ}_{0}(t)\\,c.\n$$\n\nEvaluating this identity at $t=0$ gives\n\n$$\nx(0)={Φ}_{0}(0)c,\n$$\n\nwhich is exactly line $\\text{L3}.$ Therefore, $\\text{L3}$ follows from $\\text{L2}$ by $\\text{evaluating both sides at }t=0.$\n\n- Next, we consider lines $\\text{L3}$, $\\text{L4},$ and $\\text{L5}.$ From $\\text{L3}$ we have\n\n$$\nx(0)={Φ}_{0}(0)c,\n$$\n\nand from $\\text{L4}$ we know ${Φ}_{0}(0)={I}_{n}.$ Substituting ${Φ}_{0}(0)={I}_{n}$ into $x(0)={Φ}_{0}(0)c$ gives\n\n$$\nx(0)={I}_{n}c=c,\n$$\n\nwhich is exactly line $\\text{L5}.$ Thus, $\\text{L5}$ follows from lines $\\text{L3}$ and $\\text{L4}$ by $\\text{substituting }{Φ}_{0}(0)={I}_{n}\\text{ into }x(0)={Φ}_{0}(0)c.$\n\n- Finally, we consider lines $\\text{L1}$, $\\text{L2},$ $\\text{L5},$ and $\\text{L6}.$ From $\\text{L1}$ we have ${Φ}_{0}(t)={e}^{At},$ and from $\\text{L5}$ we know $c=x(0).$ Substituting ${Φ}_{0}(t)={e}^{At}$ from $\\text{L1}$ and $c=x(0)$ from $\\text{L5}$ into $x(t)={Φ}_{0}(t)\\,c$ (line $\\text{L2}$), we obtain\n\n$$\nx(t)={e}^{At}\\,x(0).\n$$\n\nThus, $\\text{L6}$ follows from $\\text{L2}$ and substitution from $\\text{L1}\\text{ and }\\text{L5}.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396937 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396938 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396937 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396939 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396937 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396940 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396937 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396941 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396937 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045494 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396937 #edb/ref 1077 "field-3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396937 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186396939 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396937 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "62e5d724-e4aa-50ec-8d98-2ca352e011f4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396938 #edb/ref 1080 "$\\text{L1}$ and $\\text{L2}$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396938 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396938 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "614d6ab5-5628-5fbe-818a-c13fdda2c28e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396939 #edb/ref 1080 "$\\text{L1}$ and $\\text{L5}$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396939 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396939 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "ce094f55-879b-5b96-bedb-c8a97168bac2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396940 #edb/ref 1080 "$\\text{L3}$ and $\\text{L4}$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396940 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396940 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "cccff4fe-20c3-5cb7-9681-92cc25121511" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396941 #edb/ref 1080 "$\\text{L1}$ and $\\text{L3}$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396941 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396941 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "ab84e7ed-d6a8-520d-8b8d-917218916f48" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396942 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396943 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396942 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396944 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396942 #edb/ref 1075 #ed